            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono">
              {projects[2].tech.map((t) => (
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-200/70 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-300/60 dark:border-zinc-700/50">
